WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,950 --> 00:00:04,850
everyone listen

2
00:00:05,190 --> 00:00:06,790
Be imaginative about your powers

3
00:00:07,190 --> 00:00:08,670
Your powers are all very powerful

4
00:00:09,190 --> 00:00:11,390
In actual combat, special abilities must be brought into full play

5
00:00:11,710 --> 00:00:14,870
You must imagine the most suitable means for the moment

6
00:00:15,110 --> 00:00:17,590
If you find that your power can't be used to attack

7
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,990
Then use it for defense, auxiliary, and control.

8
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:24,430
Now imagine those mutants lost and surrounded

9
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,750
Don’t release the Earth Split directly under their feet

10
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,550
Instead, they used the cracks in the ground to surround them.

11
00:00:30,070 --> 00:00:32,550
Your teammate's superpower is very lethal but not accurate enough.

12
00:00:32,670 --> 00:00:33,750
You surround your target

13
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,550
Isn't it just to help teammates fix the situation?
